Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,game!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if these virtual\Nberries have any taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.19,0:01:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I haven't eaten in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.47,0:01:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think anyone's\Nserving food in that shack?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a house in the middle of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems a little too convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.55,0:01:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's another one\Nof Noah's virtual traps?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.95,0:01:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me open it and stay\Nright next to me, Mokuva.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.35,0:01:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our stepfather's old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Another blast from our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a virtual projection of our\Nfirst day in this house. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.43,0:01:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the day Gozaburo took\Nus home from the orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And it was no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,if a train from Boston is\Ntraveling at 180 miles per
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,hour and a train from New York\Nis traveling at the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:01:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize for\Ninterrupting your lesson, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems young Seto was more\Nconcerned with the backs of his eyelids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have strict orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My boss has no patience\Nfor slackers. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't slack!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you're falling\Nbehind in your studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll no longer have the\Nweekends off, starting immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've been working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have discipline, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to crush your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.45,0:02:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't have enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.75,0:02:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just not aware of them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to learn that you can\Ntrust no one at all, including me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.15,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thompson!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Confiscate Seto's toys immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.97,0:02:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe now you'll concentrate on your\Nstudies instead of wasting your brain away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that ought to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stepfather's a very wise man, and\NI think he knows what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.29,0:03:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd advise you not to disappoint him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The way they treat Seto stinks,\Nbut I know how to make him smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but first I gotta\Ngive Seto his textbook back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta study, study, study.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If I see one more textbook,\NI think I'm gonna barf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleeping? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have one more\Nlesson left tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And you left this textbook behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd be\Nmore careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, Hobson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.53,0:03:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your next lesson's in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.21,0:03:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Seto, I guess you\Nfound my hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, big bro, they can't\Ntake away everything from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So enjoy my gift, but don't let them\Nfind it. Love, Moki. Thanks, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.53,0:04:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My Duel Monsters cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're not the greatest\Ncards, but they're mine. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A Blue-Eyes White Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.97,0:04:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba made me a Blue-Eyes card.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I know I'll have the\Nreal thing in my deck. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A good show by the Kaiba Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That trip down memory lane really\Npulls at the heartstrings, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, we've had enough of\Nyour sick and twisted games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, the game's only just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.79,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready to relive every painful\Nmoment of your entire lives. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a very bumpy ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, what do you\Nexpect to gain from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.49,0:05:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that should have\Nbeen mine from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This game's pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The stars above each door represent the\Nstrength of the monster behind that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the monster and get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a clue we're missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But what can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the stars represent more than\Njust the power level of the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But what, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what if they're\Nlike directions for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, through the one star door first, then\Nthe two, then the three, then the four.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.23,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and the reason you and I have been\Ntraveling around in circles is because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,we've only been choosing to battle\Nagainst the monsters that have one star.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's try this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So now I play...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Obnoxious Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.37,0:05:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.59,0:05:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go through and find Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A bit brisk, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even feel my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Advantage number 204 of being a penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have thermo-insulated flipper feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.73,0:06:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get back to business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.87,0:06:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The sooner you make your move, the sooner\NI can freeze you over and win this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're already knee-deep in ice, and\Nthe worst is yet to come, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My all-powerful Flying Penguin is ready to\Nsoar straight through your puny defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If his Flying Penguin\Nattacks, I'll be wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I place you on the playing field\Nto defend me, then he'll just destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.03,0:06:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So very true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And if your Deckmaster is destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.39,0:06:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,well, then you automatically\Nlose the duel, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.99,0:06:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one monster face down in defense\Nmode, and then I'll end my turn, Krump.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,An extremely desperate move for\Nan extremely desperate girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And my hand continues\Nto grow more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying penguin attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes your face down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're back where\Nyou started. Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You revealed my scalangle,\Nwhich lets me draw one new card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.91,0:07:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Magic formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This may come in handy.\NI ran the numbers and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you've run out of luck\Nso play whatever pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,card you'd like because\Nit's only a matter of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,time before you're\Nfrozen here forever or my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,name isn't adrian\Nrandolph from the third a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,master in the art of\Nnumber crunching i must say
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and best dressed penguin\Nin the world you are a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,weird little bird crump\Nand i'm in the mood for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,a barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.44,0:07:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Mahavailo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's not powerful enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,beat Flying Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.59,0:08:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, don't give up so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.99,0:08:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a secret skill that can help
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.61,0:08:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of a skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.49,0:08:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.59,0:08:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi once told me about this
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.12,0:08:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know which\Ncard is most like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,purple guy with the big hat, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, big hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean my Dark Magician card.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,though it's pretty great, I don't think\Nit's the card that's most like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.97,0:08:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.81,0:08:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maha Vilo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not be as strong\Nas the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not when you first\Nlook at him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you look closer, you'll\Nsee a hidden power deep inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.51,0:08:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hidden strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Maha Vilo in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's weak! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.01,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out, I activate magic formula!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising my monster's attack points by 500!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.31,0:09:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have failed all\Nof your math courses, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.17,0:09:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's still too short on attack\Npoints to defeat my flying penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you don't know about\NMahavailo's hidden power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets 500 extra attack points\Nfor each one of my magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.71,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.09,0:09:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Mahavailo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.89,0:09:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his flying penguin\Nwith sacred lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.17,0:09:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Add this up, crump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra crispy fried penguin, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.29,0:09:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe, at least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.19,0:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much\Nlonger I can last out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Taya's getting louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yami and I have to defeat more\Nof Noah's monsters so we can get
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,through this virtual maze and\Nfind Taya before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see another set of doors ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the three-star door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Swift Gaia, the Fierce Knight! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.35,0:10:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop the attack! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Gaia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That door has been\Nequipped with a trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.49,0:10:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look more closely, right under the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Three face down cards! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:11:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that blast had to be\Na Mirror Force trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.27,0:11:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So, try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.51,0:11:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Gazelle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.03,0:11:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Dark King of the\NAbyss, a weaker monster. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Another face-down card is being activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I summon Obelisk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.65,0:11:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuse them together to form Chimera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack, my mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.23,0:11:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's that four-star monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This door has been\Nequipped with five cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:12:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah could have hidden just\Nabout anything behind that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.75,0:12:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're low on cards, so choose wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.25,0:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I only have a few cards left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating a four-star monster plus\Nfour face-down cards is no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This may do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.55,0:12:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you mustn't play\NDark Magician yet. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about the Heavy Storm Magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It destroys all magic and trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now his monster stands alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.59,0:12:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,With no face down cards to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.43,0:12:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.77,0:12:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Four-star Lady Bug of\NDuke should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem weak, but watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.01,0:12:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It automatically destroys\Nall four-star monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent move. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I had that\Nlittle critter stashed in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the last door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.33,0:13:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Taya! Stay strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Bolt Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.11,0:13:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And as an extra precaution,\NI'll play one card face down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little turkey only\Nhas 800 defense points!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can stuff it and\Nroast it with one blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Crump!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahavailo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack his bullpen twin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All my calculations\Nwere right out of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate Revenge Sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Mahavailo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.89,0:13:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge Sacrifice destroys the\Ncard you used to attack my monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll defend\Nmyself with this monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The impenetrable Defender Iceberg!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.81,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Check that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a giant ice cube! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.39,0:14:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant ice cube with\N2,450 defense points!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.37,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get past that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place this face down...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and summon Penguin Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This little bird is a real blast, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when my Deck Master\Nability gets it a boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.65,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot it can attack\Nyour life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you lost a chunk of life,\Npoint, you've gained another chunk of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's quite chilling, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Crump, I'm not out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These two cards won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.85,0:15:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one thing you can do, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Move me onto the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it's your last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.07,0:15:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.53,0:15:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I move Dark Magician Girl to the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize if your\NDeckmaster is destroyed, you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have a pathetic\Nhand to make that move!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch and learn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Ocean of Regeneration and\Nbring back my old friend, Penguin Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows\Nme to bring any water
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.85,0:15:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,monster back from my\Ngraveyard for one turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Penguin Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Attacker life points directly again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly, I'm in the mood\Nfor a tall glass of ice tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll return to the\Nreal world as a Freemur!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.53,0:16:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone, Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If she loses this duel,\Nshe'll be trapped here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not experienced enough\Nand she's losing badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya can win, Yugi, by trusting herself\Nand believing in the heart of the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm down to my last few life\Npoints and my dark magician
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,girl isn't strong enough\Nto get past his defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.69,0:16:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, since she's my deck master, if\Nshe's destroyed, I automatically lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya, there is one card in\Nyour deck that can save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.35,0:16:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the first card you picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it the Sage's Stone Magic card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.95,0:16:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the card you need to draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But it could be at the bottom\Nof my deck for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:17:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you draw\Nthis card. To do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.45,0:17:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I must first invoke my\NDeckmaster's special ability
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to call upon every\Nmonster in your graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.05,0:17:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magic Energies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.59,0:17:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hear my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, enter our graveyard\Nand revive the monsters within!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.15,0:17:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, I have formed a soul circle with\Nthe four monsters in your card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows you to draw four new cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, did I draw the card I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is. Now to play\Nit. Stupid ice. There,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,did it So what exactly does this card do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.79,0:17:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with my duel disc?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.77,0:17:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician But how was he summoned?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.57,0:18:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea where he came\Nfrom, but I am not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My calculations assured me\Nthat I would win this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This just doesn't add up at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the Sage of Stone Magic\Ncard bestows upon me the unique
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.45,0:18:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,ability to call forth the Dark\NMagician from any nearby player's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Double Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Our task is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.25,0:19:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was almost a human ice pop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.33,0:19:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.37,0:19:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, Téa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that we're together,\NI promise it'll stay that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.19,0:19:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Little do they realize I'm\Njust getting warmed up, fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll never escape my\Nvirtual universe! Never!
